    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_01",
      "hash64": "2F8FD4C3B7EC7BAA",
      "text": "Einen Moment bitte, Direktor Cyano![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_05",
      "hash64": "1F17C23F0FC02E88",
      "text": "Ja, schau mal einer an! Clavi, altes Haus!\\nDu hier? Gut siehst du aus![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_02",
      "hash64": "2F8FD3C3B7EC79F7",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Natürlich bin ich hier! Ich bin hier der Direktor!\\nUnd bitte nenn mich nicht so vor Schülern.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_03",
      "hash64": "2F8FD2C3B7EC7844",
      "text": "Hatten wir uns außerdem nicht darauf geeinigt,\\ndass wir uns in meinem Büro treffen?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_06",
      "hash64": "1F17C53F0FC033A1",
      "text": "Ach ja? Das muss mir entfallen sein![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_07",
      "hash64": "1F17C43F0FC031EE",
      "text": "Aber Schwamm drüber! Es ging doch ohnehin um\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0F0E,0000)]diesen Schülerdiese Schülerin, oder nicht?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
