      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_05",
      "hash64": "2F8FD0C3B7EC74DE",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Verzeihung, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]. Du bist\\nsicher\\r\\ngerade\\r\\netwas\\r\\nverwirrt.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
