      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_09",
      "hash64": "1F17BE3F0FC027BC",
      "text": "Ha, gute Frage, Clavi! Nun ja, also die Sache\\nist die...[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_10",
      "hash64": "1F14413F0FBD1D7E",
      "text": "Hm...\\c\\nWas war noch gleich der Grund...?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_11",
      "hash64": "1F14423F0FBD1F31",
      "text": "Ach ja, richtig! Kitakami!\\c\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0302,0000)]ErSie war doch auf der Exkursion dort mit einer\\nunserer Schülerinnen unterwegs, nicht wahr?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0302",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_12",
      "hash64": "1F143F3F0FBD1A18",
      "text": "Ich glaube, sie heißt Hana. Sie hat dich jedenfalls\\nempfohlen.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_13",
      "hash64": "1F14403F0FBD1BCB",
      "text": "Ach ja! Verlässliche Quellen haben mir berichtet,\\ndass es hier [VAR 0x1100(00FF,1B1B,0000)]einen interessanten Schülereine interessante Schülerin gibt.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "1B1B",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_14",
      "hash64": "1F14453F0FBD244A",
      "text": "Ich habe mich auch eben etwas in der Schule\\numgehört... Dein Name scheint ja in aller\\r\\nMunde zu sein.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_15",
      "hash64": "1F14463F0FBD25FD",
      "text": "Und jetzt, wo du so vor mir stehst...\\nJa, doch! Du hast mich überzeugt![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_09",
      "hash64": "2F8FCCC3B7EC6E12",
      "text": "Oho, du siehst also auch Potenzial in [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0303,0000)]ihmihr?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0303",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_16",
      "hash64": "1F14433F0FBD20E4",
      "text": "Als [VAR 0x1100(00FF,1210,0000)]AustauschschülerAustauschschülerin würdest du sicher frischen\\nWind in unsere Akademie bringen![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "1210",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_10",
      "hash64": "2F8C4FC3B7E963D4",
      "text": "Cyano verfügt über eine gute Menschenkenntnis,\\ndas muss man ihm lassen.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_11",
      "hash64": "2F8C50C3B7E96587",
      "text": "Ich würde mich sehr freuen, wenn du die\\nBlaubeer-Akademie besuchen und dort\\r\\nneue Erfahrungen sammeln würdest.\\c\\nNatürlich nur, wenn du das auch möchtest.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
